                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.1.0-beta.3 (2026-02-26)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bugs Fixed&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added public &lt;code&gt;InterimResponseConfigBase InterimResponse&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.Provisioning.Storage_1.2.0-beta.1"&gt;Azure.Provisioning.Storage_1.2.0-beta.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.2.0-beta.1 (2026-03-02)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Breaking Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;StorageAccount.PrivateEndpointConnections&lt;/code&gt; has been renamed to &lt;code&gt;StorageAccount.PrivateEndpointConnectionResources&lt;/code&gt; and its type changed from &lt;code&gt;BicepList&amp;lt;StoragePrivateEndpointConnectionData&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;BicepList&amp;lt;StoragePrivateEndpointConnection&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;. The old property is preserved but marked as obsolete.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;StorageActiveDirectoryProperties.DomainGuid&lt;/code&gt; has been renamed to &lt;code&gt;StorageActiveDirectoryProperties.ActiveDirectoryDomainGuid&lt;/code&gt;. The old property is preserved but marked as obsolete.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;ExecutionTrigger.TriggerType&lt;/code&gt; has been renamed to &lt;code&gt;ExecutionTrigger.TaskExecutionTriggerType&lt;/code&gt; with type changed from &lt;code&gt;ExecutionTriggerType&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;TaskExecutionTriggerType&lt;/code&gt;. The old property is preserved but marked as obsolete.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Other Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regenerated from &lt;code&gt;Azure.ResourceManager.Storage&lt;/code&gt; version 1.6.0 with new API version &lt;code&gt;2025-06-01&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.Provisioning.ContainerService_1.0.0-beta.5"&gt;Azure.Provisioning.ContainerService_1.0.0-beta.5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.0.0-beta.5 (2026-03-03)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regenerated from &lt;code&gt;Azure.ResourceManager.ContainerService&lt;/code&gt; version 1.3.1.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.Provisioning.Communication_1.0.0-beta.4"&gt;Azure.Provisioning.Communication_1.0.0-beta.4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.0.0-beta.4 (2026-03-03)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regenerated from the latest &lt;code&gt;Azure.ResourceManager.Communication&lt;/code&gt; package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated default API version from &lt;code&gt;2023-04-01&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;2025-09-01&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added new resources: &lt;code&gt;CommunicationSmtpUsername&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;EmailSuppressionList&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;EmailSuppressionListAddress&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added new model: &lt;code&gt;CommunicationPublicNetworkAccess&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;IsLocalAuthDisabled&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;PublicNetworkAccess&lt;/code&gt; properties to &lt;code&gt;CommunicationService&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;ResourceVersions&lt;/code&gt; to all resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
            </content>
  </entry>
